                        "sense_id": "bcd0ce07-c6f2-3629-847e-c978977e2759",
                        "entry_id": "0315ca81-7753-32bd-a426-5aa3aeadecdb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Leather tanned from the skin of a hog."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "83719ffc-c453-42fd-856a-616276202019",
                                "sense_id": "bcd0ce07-c6f2-3629-847e-c978977e2759",
                                "text": "My spiritual backbone stiffened, and I held my head high, looking all men in the eyes. And I did these things, not that I was an egotist, not that I was impervious to the critical glances of my fellows, but because of a certain hogskin belt, plethoric and sweat-bewrinkled, which buckled next the skin above the hips."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b48b2e8-d5c4-3cf6-ad1c-77586e9817eb",
                        "entry_id": "0315ca81-7753-32bd-a426-5aa3aeadecdb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The skin of a pig used as a bottle for water or wine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18462485-4356-4a22-9a30-510800bf4306",
                                "sense_id": "9b48b2e8-d5c4-3cf6-ad1c-77586e9817eb",
                                "text": "Other Arabs were filling black hog-skins with water—skins which, well filled, and distended with water till the short legs projected painfully out of the proper line, looked like the corpses of hogs bloated by drowning."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
